I just won my first game playing PL 10, and I have some observations:

Spoilers may follow...


1.  Gauntlets of power are VASTLY improved.  I had no problem carrying just
    about whatever I wanted, other than two boulders :-)

2.  Mirrors no longer tell you where the Wiz is (ie above or below you) if you
    are blind, at least they didn't after several tries of 100 applications.
    That was rather annoying, but made life somewhat more interesting.

3.  I had a near-death experience when the Wiz gated in a succubus and she
    took off my armor, and the surrounding monsters proceeded to nuke me.  I
    will always remember that succubus :-)

I may have set a record for the lowest total hit-points in victory - only 66.
It is the only character in the top 20 on my machine to have less than 70
hit-points.  I was playing a priest, and found a WOW on level 3.

